              {
                "detail": 0,
                "format": 0,
                "mode": "normal",
                "style": "",
                "text": "Thirty seconds, seven scenes, on a loop: what TraderBuddy is for, in the order you would meet it. The sequence is drawn live in your browser from a few hundred lines of script, with no video file behind it, so you can pause it, restart it, or jump to any scene.",
